      "writtenOn": "2020-10-01T21:11:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, I\u0027d missed that the file is already half-designed to remove the Try.SRC states. \n\nI\u0027m hoping we can keep the number of ifdef\u0027s in the file to a minimum.  The state transitions to undefined states definitely need ifdef\u0027d out, but I\u0027m not as certain about some of these supporting functions and their related variables (ex. pd_try_src).\n\nAnyone else have opinions here?",
      "parentUuid": "b948e884_8ea66a7f",
      "revId": "e0c44bc455defbc2ebf8f36f24b1a811443e6103",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
